al_right_coalition_heartland: Staal Right Coalition ?][? if not in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland and not in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland and not in_weimar_coalition_heartland and not in_grand_coalition_heartland and not in_far_right_coalition_heartland and not in_popular_front_heartland and not in_left_front_heartland and not in_center_right_coalition_heartland and not in_right_coalition_heartland and not marcher_toleration_heartland and not heartland_leader == "Goodryke" and heartland_leader != "Staal" and chancellor != royalist_chancellor and ddp_name != 0: caretaker government ?]

