{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Left is interested in radical, transformative policies and cooperation with the KPD.">Left</span>!} strength: [+ left_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ left_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="The Center is a faction of Center Vaelists, between reform and revolution.">Unionists</span>!} strength: [+ center_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ center_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Labor's goal is economic reform and benefits for organized workers.">Labor</span>!} strength: [+ labor_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ labor_dissent : dissent +]

{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Revisionists are pragmatic participants in government, and seek to expand the welfare state and defend democracy.">Reformist</span>!} strength: [+ reformist_strength : strength +], dissent: [+ reformist_dissent : dissent +]

